      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've checked the funds and the card isn't expired. i'm also seeing some weird behavior where the error sometimes happens on a valid test card but then works a second later. could it be some kind of rate limiting or a glitch in how the payload is being structured? maybe something is getting lost in transit?",
